CM_ SG_ 212 Byte4 "Cluster status byte (stored).";
CM_ SG_ 212 Byte5 "Cluster status byte (stored).";
CM_ SG_ 212 StatusFlags "Bit 0 cluster error flag, bit 1 snapshot B trigger, bit 3 snapshot A trigger.";
CM_ SG_ 212 AliveCounter "Alive counter; a repeated value rejects the frame.";
CM_ SG_ 212 Checksum "CRC-8 as 0x0CD.";
